{%- comment -%}
  Wordmark fallback used wherever no logo image has been uploaded.

  The bundled icon-logo-* SVGs are the original Odd Ritual lettering, so they
  are wrong for this store. Rather than ship the wrong brand, render the brand
  name as text in the theme's own type until a real logo is uploaded under
  Theme settings → Brand marks.

  Params: class (extra classes for sizing at each call site)
{%- endcomment -%}
<span class="brand-wordmark {{ class }}">{{ settings.brand_name | default: shop.name }}</span>
